{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "story_headbr_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_headbr_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "强中自有强中手",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_headbr_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "20912a8479ea1e37afbacff2f9af449eedfb996e1ca67a250a6f1a4a41b60b45",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "啊，太好了，凛冬，烈夏，快过来！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "快点，别愣着！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "怎么，是要帮忙打架？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "打架？来了来了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "不是，听我说——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "不知道哪个缺心眼的跑到杜宾面前炫耀零食去了，现在训练室里有几个刚来的感染者小孩上入门健身兴趣课，拜托你们照顾一下——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "哦哦，零食网络！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "......照顾小孩子？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "注意事项我写在便签上了——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "拜托你们——到时候请你们吃饭——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "哇哦，跑得好快，坚雷教官是库兰塔吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "照顾小孩子为什么找我们？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "......对哦，为什么找我们，咱们俩看起来像是会带小孩的吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "而且给一群刚被接来罗德岛的小孩上课，呃呃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "啧，好麻烦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "......呿，也就一天，咬咬牙就过去了。走吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "......哈哈，那个......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "冬将军英明神武十分厉害所向披靡......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "啊？你跑什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "我会给你留蜂蜜的！我才不要带小孩子上课，这活你接！就这么定了，加油——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "喂！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "*乌萨斯粗口*好烦！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "（上课，想着就头疼......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "（......哦，听起来不是很闹？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "（那还好。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "来来来，看我，都听我号令！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "就你刚才那样子还想当大哥？我一拳就打趴下了！但你还不错，从今天起你就是我的一号小弟了！你是二号，你是三号！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "这里就是我的新地盘！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "呦，刚进来的这一个！来得最晚，你就当我们最小的小弟！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "以后都要叫我大姐头，听到了没？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "（哦呦？把这一群都打服了，她挺厉害的哦。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "（不对不能这么想，我是来管他们的......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "小胳膊小腿的，瞎嘚瑟什么呢！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "（这种情况，打一顿或许能听话？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "（不行，不能打，我是来教他们的。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "哎，你们，听好！你们的教官有点事情，今天我来照管你们一天。都好好听话！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "便签......在这里。哎，你，刚才乱叫的那个，从掩体上下来！站那么高摔下来可别哭，我可不是什么医疗干员。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "你这个小弟在对大姐头说什么！谁会哭？我才不会摔下来！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小孩们",
      "text": "说得对！说得对！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "（啊，忍住，不能打，不能打。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "“保证他们安全的同时教会器械的名字以及它们的用法，也可以让他们上手练练，一定注意安全！”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "（坚雷教官这字真的是都要飞出去了。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "喂，来吧，坚雷教官给你们留的作业......你怎么还在掩体上站着？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "麻烦死了......好好听话，下来！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "不下！这里是只有大姐头才能上来的地方！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小孩们",
      "text": "没错！没错！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "（真的好想上去打她一顿！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "我是来替教官照看你的，你站上面危险，快下来！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "哼，那又怎样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "......听话！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "你是我小弟我为什么要听你的，我是大姐头，你应该听我的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小孩们",
      "text": "听大姐头的！听大姐头的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "啊？我应该听你的？你是不是真的想让我揍你啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "你打不过我~我会用法术打你！你没长石头你不会吧~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "（哇这小孩，又不能打！啊，好想回去把烈夏抓回来打一顿——）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "而且我厉害得很，才不要你照看，我要教官！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "教官让我管你！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "你是小弟我不要你管！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "（这孩子越凶越不听话啊？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "（早露在就好了，我又做不来她那种好学生大姐姐的样子，这个小孩不听我的其他的就更不会听了......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "（这样下去没完了......得让她服我才行。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "你厉害吗？我不觉得你厉害，教官都让我来管你了，我就比你厉害，我才是这里的大姐头。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "你胡说！我才是大姐头！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "我不服你，要不我们打个赌？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小孩们",
      "text": "打赌！打赌！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "我赌你绝对赢不过我，你要是输了就乖乖听我话，你赢了，我就做你小弟！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "你本来就是我小弟，我才不赌。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "对啊我本来就是你小弟，我......嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "（我绕进去了？啊！好烦！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "......你不赌你就是胆小鬼，最小的小弟，你是觉得肯定赢不了才不赌的，你就不配做大姐头！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "我就是大姐头，你才是小弟！赌就赌！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "你擅长什么！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "抓石子！我抓石子最最最厉害！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "你到时候乖乖叫我大姐头！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "走，说好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小孩们",
      "text": "比赛！比赛！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "得让你这个大姐头看一下，什么才叫作真正的大姐头！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "（我之前抓石子玩过多少次了，这小丫头肯定赢不过我......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "我开始了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "（往上抛，接住......反手，再接，再抛，一个、两个、三个、一个......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "过了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "哼！第一关谁不会。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "好，第二关~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "（抛，接住两个，抛，抓一接一，抛，再接住......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "掉掉掉！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "（哪那么容易就掉！这小丫头真的......？哦？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "（一个、两个、三个、一个......好了好了，第二关过了。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "嗯，第三关。抛、抓，两个、三个、一个......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "掉！掉！掉呀！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "都接住了哦~我要开始最后一关了哦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "哼，就这谁不会~我也行！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "（呼——平静一下。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "（好，开始！抓七个，抛！接住，抛四个，再抓住，再抛，接，三、二、一，成了！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "最后一下了哦~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "（八个，反手，接住！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "掉了两个掉了两个！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小孩们",
      "text": "两个！两个！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "哎呀，失误了，不过也还行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "该你了，来吧小丫头，让我看看你抓得怎么样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "哼，不用你说，我开始了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "而且，不要叫我小丫头，要叫我大姐头。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "行，大姐头，开始！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "............",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "（哦哦哦她确实玩得不错......动作挺利索啊，怪不得敢那样说......确实挺厉害啊，要结束了要结束了......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "哦！你掉了三个！你输了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "行吧，过来听话。然后，不许再爬到掩体上去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "你、你耍赖！刚才那个不算！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "我耍赖？你才耍赖吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "谁耍赖！谁耍赖！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "我是大姐头我才不会耍赖！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小孩们",
      "text": "大姐头不会耍赖！大姐头不会耍赖！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "哈哈哈哈哈，不服再来！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "一二三四五六七......你抓住了七个，进步了啊？但我八个，你又输了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "来，听话了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "......哼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "（啊？我好不容易想的法子，这孩子怎么说话不算话。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "（现在小孩都这样吗？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "......不说话算话的话，你那些......一号二号小弟，就不把你当大姐头了哦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "好吧，要干什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "认识器械名和它们的用法，如果喜欢你们可以上手练练。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "那开始吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小孩们",
      "text": "好的大姐头！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "（脸都垮了，这是伤心了？小孩子果然就是好麻烦！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "那个，你抓石子其实挺厉害的，只是我玩的时间更长，就更熟练。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "你最后抛的时候抖下手腕，石子就会这样——稍稍分个前后，用手背接起来就不会那么分散，就能接到更多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "你试试。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "一二三四五六七八......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "嘿，真的欸。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "♪~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "是很有用吧？不垮脸了？那咱们开始吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "好好学！乖乖等坚雷教官回来，我就教你个顶级抓石子秘诀，把那个练好了，你打遍天下无敌手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "真的吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "骗你干什么。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "好哎！！姐姐真好！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小孩们",
      "text": "姐姐真好！姐姐真好！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "我又不教你们，瞎叫唤什么？都来听我讲课！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "（哈。这就叫姐姐了。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "来，开始吧，都来好好听。这个是杠铃，这边这个立架叫“史密斯架”，把杠铃杆固定在这边这个轨道里以后，会怎么样？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "......杠铃就拿不走了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "啊？不是，史密斯架会限制杠铃的滑动轨迹，这样在做训练时杠铃就不会前后摆动，能避免对你的腰或者膝盖造成伤害。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "像这样，可以做深蹲......这样拿着，然后保证膝盖不要超过脚尖，呼气蹲下，吸气起来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "也可以躺卧在这里，往上推举，锻炼上肢力量。但是训练时要注意，如果选用重量太大的杠铃而又无法支撑，压下来的话你就会，咯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "所以要十分小心，记住了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小孩们",
      "text": "记住了！杠铃不能太重，否则我们会被压断！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "嗯？嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "也对，杠铃太重会压断你们，所以很危险，锻炼时要小心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "然后这个是单双杠引体向上架。背对支撑点，双手抓住抓手，然后胳膊架在横梁上，身体悬空，像这样卷腹，锻炼你的腹部。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "嗯......练这个不会轻易受伤，有人想试试吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "嗯，我要试试！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "有点高，我扶你上去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "嘿！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "抓住这里？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "对，然后胳膊肘放上去，支撑自己的身体......可以做到吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "可以！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "固定住自己的上半身，腰背挺直，腹部用力，腿绷直用腹部力量抬起来，吸气，呼气......对。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "（抖抖抖抖抖）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "哎呀，你胳膊这里源石都长出来了，别磕到......这里会痛吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "不要碰！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "在立架上别乱动！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "乱动伤到自己怎么办？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "......姐姐没有长石头吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "......没有，怎么了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "那姐姐离我远点。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "......先从立架上下来吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "我为什么要离你远点？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "因为我得病了，别人都躲着我，还拿石头砸我。你又没长石头，你为什么不离我远点？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "想什么呢，这里长石头的人多了去了，坚雷教官没和你说吗？好好训练！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "他们拿石头砸你你打回去了没？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "打回去了！狠狠地打了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "好样的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "......呃，但打架还是不好的，以后不能再乱打架了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "为什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "嗯......就是不好啦，听话，以后不要随便打架。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "好吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "行吧，这个器械先练到这里，标准的动作坚雷教官之后会再教你们，我把剩下的器械都给你们说一下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "姐姐，你叫什么名字？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "嗯？我叫......凛冬。我的代号是，凛冬。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "代号？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "对，我现在叫凛冬。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "你呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "我还没有代号......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "等我想好了以后就告诉姐姐！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "哈哈，好啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "好！教完了，都记住了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "那当然，我多聪明！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小孩们",
      "text": "都记住啦！都记住啦！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "要是喜欢的话，以后就继续跟着坚雷教官上这个课，凭兴趣学一些锻炼身体的方法也挺好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "不只是坚雷教官，还有其他干员也会开一些入门兴趣课，感兴趣的话都可以去听听看。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "罗德岛还有挺多和你们年龄差不多的人，也可以找他们玩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "结束了，现在就等坚雷教官回来吧，我来教你那个抓石子的超绝技巧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "超绝技巧！！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小孩们",
      "text": "我也要学！我也要学！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "好，都过来，就是这样，你们只需要在这里......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "哎呀，我回来了，问题解决了！万事大吉！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "教官。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小孩们",
      "text": "教官。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "啊凛冬，今天辛苦了，待会儿请你吃晚饭~哎，烈夏呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "哈，她一听看小孩，一早就跑了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "哈哈哈，那今天吃晚饭就没她的份咯~给我讲讲吧，今天课上得怎么样？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "教官，我把器械的名称和用法都教给他们了，他们也上手练了几个，做得都挺好的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "不错不错，接下来就是我的工作了，你先休息休息。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "嗯，我去把器械收拾一下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "孩子们，过来吧，我检查一下你们的学习成果，今天就可以结束啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小孩们",
      "text": "......嗯。这个是杠铃，在立架里放好，可以固定住，这样子锻炼腿上的肌肉，在这里躺着做推举的话，可以锻炼胳膊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小孩们",
      "text": "这个是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小孩们",
      "text": "那个是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "不错，记得都挺清楚的。练过以后身上有哪里疼吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小孩们",
      "text": "没有！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "来，让我再检查检查。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "嗯，都没受伤，很不错~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "那今天就到这里啦，你们都回宿舍好好休息，晚上可以去食堂吃点自己喜欢的，四处转转也可以。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "走吧~解散！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小孩们",
      "text": "教官再见，凛冬姐姐再见~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "再见~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "嗯，再见。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "那凛冬姐姐是不是要走了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "是的~今天是特殊情况，凛冬已经完成任务了，以后都是我来给你们上课。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "那......凛冬姐姐以后可以来和我一起上课吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "哦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "小丫头意外地还挺黏你的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "啊......啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "凛冬姐姐以后不来了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "啊，对，我只是今天偶然来帮忙而已，这些知识对我来说太基础了。所以以后就......嗯......以后就不会来了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "你好好听教官话，适应罗德岛的生活就行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "哦......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "哈哈，挺有意思，我倒是没有想到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "小丫头，她给你说什么了，你这么喜欢她？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "凛冬姐姐说以后不要乱打架，打架不好！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "嗯嗯......哦哦......凛冬说不要打架......噗，好，走吧走吧，回宿舍歇着吧~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "嗯......教官再见，凛冬姐姐再见......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "凛冬姐姐......我后天上课也是在这个训练室。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "嗯嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "哎呀，跑了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "看你样子没听懂啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "她的意思是下回也想让你来呀，哈哈哈，你到底做什么了，小姑娘这么喜欢你？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "我怎么没有这种待遇？......难道我看起来很凶吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "欸欸？有人找我......啊，我得先走了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "这是我的饭卡，拿去吃晚饭吧，回头放我宿舍门口就行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "吃点好的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "嗯，谢谢教官！教官再见！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "哈哈！找了你半天，原来你在这里！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "我带来了风味蜜饮！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "切！你还好意思来？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "别这样嘛！这可是我珍藏了好久的呢！一起喝咯~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "哼，你跑了，我和一堆小孩子待一天！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "哈哈哈哈哈哈我们冬将军也会带小孩啊~哈哈哈！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "......哪像夏将军还会逃跑呢！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "哎呀哎呀都拿了蜜饮来了怎么还咬着不放......喝喝喝！算我给你赔罪啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "好喝吧！说了是我珍藏的呢！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "嗯......是挺好喝。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "来，讲讲你今天带小孩都发生了什么事啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "能有什么，就是给他们上课。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "但是......挺奇怪的，今天有个小姑娘好像挺喜欢我的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "小姑娘喜欢你？你该不会是把人家打了一顿，吓得她不敢不听你的话吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "你找打啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "哎哎哎不是不是你说你说我听着。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "就是......她下课之后不想让我走，还说想让我下节课也去陪她一起上......我肯定不会去的，那些东西我都会，但是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "怎么了，你今天怎么磨磨叽叽的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "我搞不懂为什么。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "什么为什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "她好像真的挺喜欢我的......？为什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "我以为我那么凶，还玩游戏赢她让她丢脸，讨厌说不上，我以为她不会有多喜欢我来着......但是刚才她还想让我下节课也去陪她？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "而且我觉得我之前有那样，那些......你知道的。但是她好像就也不关心，就是很想让我再去......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "咕咚咕咚咕咚......嗨！我以为啥呢！你想那么多干什么，那她就是觉得你好就喜欢你呗！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "而且她为什么不喜欢你呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "............",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "那她就是喜欢你呗！！！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "这还在食堂里你小声一点！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "呃，别晃我！我喝......我头头头晕我去买瓶水缓缓......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "你你你在这里等我一下......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "切，醉蜜还这么贪，哪天醉到从舰上掉下去都不知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "嗯......风味蜜饮，还真是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "呃，有点头晕......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "......对哦，她为什么不喜欢我呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "其实我不用在意那些事情的......那些......那些......那个小丫头根本就不在意啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "......不在意啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "嘿嘿。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "两天后"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "好，今天的课程开始~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "教官好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "怎么蔫蔫的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "嗯......没有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "猜猜是谁来了——？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "哈哈！你凛冬姐来啦！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "？？？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "text": "——耶！！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
